       "  'summary': '<p>The race for the best crypto to buy now is heating up as Bitcoin price smashes past $117,000 and an emerging DeFi payment innovator, Remittix, surges into the spotlight. Bitcoin’s climb to $117,096 (+0.49% daily) signals more than price momentum: President Trump’s executive order now allows crypto in 401(k) retirement plans, potentially unlocking trillions in [...]</p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://blockonomi.com/bitcoin-crosses-117000-and-remittix-quickly-becomes-the-most-talked-about-presale/\">Bitcoin Crosses $117,000 And Remittix Quickly Becomes The Most Talked About Presale.</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://blockonomi.com\">Blockonomi</a>.</p>',\n",
       "  'link': 'https://blockonomi.com/bitcoin-crosses-117000-and-remittix-quickly-becomes-the-most-talked-about-presale/',\n",
       "  'full_text': 'The race for the best crypto to buy now is heating up as Bitcoin price smashes past $117,000 and an emerging DeFi payment innovator, Remittix, surges into the spotlight.\\n\\nBitcoin’s climb to $117,096 (+0.49% daily) signals more than price momentum: President Trump’s executive order now allows crypto in 401(k) retirement plans, potentially unlocking trillions in fresh capital.\\n\\nAmid Bitcoin’s rally, early-stage projects with real-world use cases are drawing serious investor attention, and Remittix is rapidly being hailed as the one to watch. Here are all the details you need.\\n\\nBitcoin Price Achieves New Milestones With America’s Retirement Adoption\\n\\nBitcoin price’s leap above $117,000 marks another milestone in 2025, powered by institutional demand in its ETF products and government backing.\\n\\nPresident Trump’s order opens access to $8Trillion in U.S. retirement savings, while companies and top investors like Harvard are adding BTC ETFs to their holdings at a record pace.\\n\\nTechnical analysis points toward $125,000 as the next major target, with ETFs alone pulling in $12.8B in July, recording over $600M daily inflows.\\n\\nWith fixed supply and halving effects, analysts see this as the early stage of a long-term climb, with Bitcoin price projections ranging from $120,000–$149,000 by 2030.\\n\\nRemittix: The Next Big PayFi Disruptor You Don’t Want to Miss\\n\\nWhile Bitcoin price and on-chain stats steal headlines, Remittix (RTX) is stealing the long-term crypto investment conversation, and for good reason.\\n\\nThe high-growth crypto is not hype-driven. Instead, Remittix is set up to solve a $630B global problem: cross-border payments.\\n\\nRemittix enables direct crypto-to-bank transfers in 30+ countries, supporting 40+ cryptocurrencies and 30+ fiat currencies. No middlemen. No excessive fees. Just fast, transparent payments powered by blockchain and real-time FX conversion.\\n\\nWhy investors are piling in now, With Serious Demand\\n\\nDirect Bank Transfers — in 30+ countries, no conversion hassle.\\n\\nMulti-Asset Support — 40+ cryptos, 30+ fiats for ultimate flexibility.\\n\\nReal-Time FX Engine — instant, transparent currency conversion.\\n\\nEnterprise API — ready-made integration for banks and fintechs.\\n\\nMobile-First Wallet — user-friendly for both crypto pros and newcomers.\\n\\nThis isn’t just another token; it’s a payment infrastructure for the next decade. And with global adoption of crypto accelerating, timing couldn’t be better.\\n\\n$250,000 Incentive Program: Rewarding Early Visionaries\\n\\nRemittix is sweetening the deal with a quarter-million-dollar giveaway, a strategic push to reward early adopters before institutional money floods in, making it the best crypto to buy now.\\n\\nIn a market where Bitcoin price continues to ascend, proving that crypto is here to stay, Remittix offers the utility, timing, and market positioning that can turn early believers into big winners. Miss this, and you might be watching from the sidelines when the cycle’s top performer is crowned.\\n\\nDiscover the future of PayFi with Remittix by checking out their project here:\\n\\nWebsite: https://remittix.io/\\n\\nSocials: https://linktr.ee/remittix\\n\\n$250,000 Giveaway: https://gleam.io/competitions/nz84L-250000-remittix-giveaway\\n\\nThis is a Press Release provided by a third party who is responsible for the content. Please conduct your own research before taking any action based on the content.'},\n",
