       "  'summary': '<p>Investors seeking the next 100x crypto are shifting their focus from Dogecoin, Cardano, and Solana. Instead, they’re checking out Rollblock, with its strong fundamentals and a solid track record. Momentum in Web3 is growing fast, and RBLK is becoming one of the year’s most talked-about top crypto projects, backed by real growth and rising market [...]</p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://blockonomi.com/doge-ada-sol-falter-as-ethereum-based-rblk-gains-momentum-in-the-defi-race/\">DOGE, ADA, SOL Falter as Ethereum-Based RBLK Gains Momentum in the DeFi Race</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://blockonomi.com\">Blockonomi</a>.</p>',\n",
       "  'link': 'https://blockonomi.com/doge-ada-sol-falter-as-ethereum-based-rblk-gains-momentum-in-the-defi-race/',\n",
       "  'full_text': 'Investors seeking the next 100x crypto are shifting their focus from Dogecoin, Cardano, and Solana. Instead, they’re checking out Rollblock, with its strong fundamentals and a solid track record.\\n\\nMomentum in Web3 is growing fast, and RBLK is becoming one of the year’s most talked-about top crypto projects, backed by real growth and rising market interest. Here’s why top altcoin investors are buying into its presale.\\n\\nDogecoin Gains Momentum Despite Contrary Beliefs\\n\\nDogecoin climbed 4% to $0.23 on August 9 as whales bought over 1 billion DOGE worth more than $200 million.\\n\\nHowever, while the $0.22 support held strong through multiple tests, selling pressure hit at $0.23, with short-term Dogecoin traders and large holders taking profits.\\n\\nTradingView data shows that Dogecoin’s trading volume spiked to 780.9 million at the peak, stalling the rally. In the final hour, institutional selling pushed DOGE down to $0.227, with volume hitting eight times the daily average.\\n\\nDogecoin’s price then moved in a tight $0.227–$0.229 range. $0.22 remains key support on the crypto chart, while $0.23 is the breakout point. Dogecoin whale moves continue to drive price and sentiment.\\n\\nSolana’s Price Might Hit $300\\n\\nSolana jumped 13.4% in under a week, rebounding from its August 2 low of $155.83 after failing to break $200. The move followed Bitcoin and Ethereum rallies, putting SOL back in the race for a potential $300 run this year.\\n\\nOn Solana’s weekly chart, the bullish trend remains intact since March’s $100–$120 retest. Price now targets $183, $200, and $225, with $200 as the key barrier.\\n\\nA clean break could send it toward $260–$290. TradingView data shows that Solana buyers defended the 61.8% Fib at $156, while OBV shows steady accumulation and RSI climbs above 50. The 50-day MA is now support, boosting the bullish outlook for Solana.\\n\\nCardano Becomes a Top Gainer Crypto Token\\n\\nCardano rose to $0.8065 on August 9, driven by strong technical signals and renewed U.S. political backing for crypto. The price pattern mirrors Cardano’s past cycles, hinting at a possible run to $2.90, though they warn nothing is guaranteed in such a volatile market.\\n\\nCardano’s momentum picked up after Donald Trump’s executive order to boost crypto adoption, lifting sentiment across the sector. Cardano has been one of the top gainers, with speculation growing about a potential Cardano ETF that could increase demand.\\n\\nRollblock Scores Major Presale Victory with $11.3 Million Raised\\n\\nRollblock’s presale has drawn over $11.4 million from more than 50,000 investors, making it one of GameFi’s standout launches. The project runs on the Ethereum blockchain and hosts 12,000+ AI-powered games from top iGaming providers.\\n\\nEvery result is stored on-chain, removing the risk of manipulation and guaranteeing fair play. This transparency has earned strong community trust and positioned Rollblock as a serious Web3 gaming contender. Its native token, RBLK, is built for long-term growth.\\n\\nEach week, up to 30% of platform revenue goes to RBLK buybacks, with 60% of tokens burned and 40% given to stakers. The system cuts supply, boosts demand, and rewards loyal holders with steady income. Here are more features that could benefit Rollblock’s price movement:\\n\\nOffers sports betting on hundreds of top-notch events\\n\\nRBLK staking crypto offers some of the highest APYs in the cryptocurrency space\\n\\nEarly investors gain exposure to a live crypto product, not just a concept\\n\\nHolders of Rollblock become part of the casino, not just players\\n\\nCan RBLK Become the Next 100x Crypto?\\n\\nRollblock has jumped 580% in its presale and now trades at $0.068, making it one of 2025’s top altcoins.\\n\\nMany see RBLK as a stronger 100x contender than Solana, Cardano, or Dogecoin. Here’s how it compares against these altcoins:\\n\\nFeature Rollblock Dogecoin Cardano Solana Price $0.068 $0.227 $0.8065 $183 Utility GameFi platform with 12,000+ AI-powered games Memecoin with payment and tipping use Smart contract platform with a focus on scalability and governance High-speed blockchain for DeFi, NFTs, and dApps Potential Analysts see a possible 100x return by year-end Driven by whale activity, volatile Possible rally to $2.90 if momentum holds Potential run to $300 in 2025\\n\\nDiscover the Exciting Opportunities of the Rollblock (RBLK) Presale Today!\\n\\nWebsite: https://presale.rollblock.io/\\n\\nSocials: https://linktr.ee/rollblockcasino\\n\\nThis is a Press Release provided by a third party who is responsible for the content. Please conduct your own research before taking any action based on the content.'},\n",
