       "  'summary': '<p>The meme coin market is piping hot again: market cap is flirting with $70 billion again, showing that liquidity is flooding back into risk plays. For investors hunting the next 25x winners under $1, here are the top four meme coins currently primed for liftoff as momentum returns across the sector. Little Pepe (LILPEPE): A [...]</p>\\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://blockonomi.com/best-meme-coins-to-buy-top-4-cryptos-below-1-set-for-2500-gains/\">Best Meme Coins to Buy: Top 4 Cryptos Below $1 Set for 2500% Gains</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://blockonomi.com\">Blockonomi</a>.</p>',\n",
       "  'link': 'https://blockonomi.com/best-meme-coins-to-buy-top-4-cryptos-below-1-set-for-2500-gains/',\n",
       "  'full_text': 'The meme coin market is piping hot again: market cap is flirting with $70 billion again, showing that liquidity is flooding back into risk plays. For investors hunting the next 25x winners under $1, here are the top four meme coins currently primed for liftoff as momentum returns across the sector.\\n\\nLittle Pepe (LILPEPE) : A hyper-viral frog token building its own Layer-2 and Launchpad, mixing meme power with real infrastructure.\\n\\nRekt (REKT): A tongue-in-cheek degen favourite breaking new ATHs with roaring technical momentum and whale inflows.\\n\\nBrett (BRETT): The leading Base-chain meme just got listed on Binance US — setting up for an institutional-fuelled breakout.\\n\\nSnek (SNEK): The Cardano meme king backed by official ecosystem support — quietly lining up another 9,000%-style surge.\\n\\nLittle Pepe ($LILPEPE): Small Frog, Giant Ambitions\\n\\nDon’t let the “little” fool you, Little Pepe is a tiny amphibian with titanic momentum. While many meme coins croak loudly and deliver little, LILPEPE has quietly built a launchpad, a Layer-2 ecosystem, and one of the fastest-moving presales in crypto history. That’s why it sits at the top of our list of meme coins below $1, poised for explosive 2500% upside. Backed by a growing Layer-2, EVM-compatible infrastructure, Little Pepe isn’t just a meme; it’s a springboard for other tokens. The Pepe Launchpad allows low-cap coins to launch in a tax-free, bot-resistant environment, generating real fee revenue into the ecosystem while attracting budding developers. This positions LILPEPE as a platform for the next wave of meme mania. Investor trust is already pouring in. The presale has raced past $15.3 million, leaping stage-by-stage from $0.001 to $0.0018, an 80% price climb before even listing. With a confirmed CoinMarketCap listing, smart contract audit, and no VC allocation that could dump on retail traders, Little Pepe is attracting both communities and whales seeking early asymmetric upside. The fundamentals only strengthen when we factor in its 0% buy/sell tax, sniper bot resistance, and extremely viral $777K giveaway, which puts 10 lucky holders in line to win $77,000 each. In response, social media engagement has surged, turning LILPEPE into a culture coin with utility, the perfect formula in the current hype-driven, infrastructure-hungry meme market. On launch (scheduled at $0.003), analysts expect Little Pepe to surge rapidly toward $0.1–$0.3, backed by imminent Tier-1 CEX listings and a sea of presale FOMO buyers locked out of earlier rounds. That’s a potential 70x–100x run, with room to reach even higher if the launchpad gains traction and Pepe’s Layer-2 gains developer attention. Nothing “little” about that.\\n\\nRekt (REKT): The Meme Coin Turning Traders Into Millionaires\\n\\nREKT might sound like a joke about losing money, but this meme coin has only rekt those who faded it since its launch. Trading at just $0.0000011, it recently smashed into new all-time highs on the back of 8+% daily gains and bullish technicals. Capital rotation from SPX6900, PENGU, BONK, and other July outperformers flows into REKT, pushing it further into price discovery.\\n\\nREKT Price Chart | Source: CoinGecko\\n\\nMomentum traders believe REKT could jump 20–30x from current levels, primarily as the future market volume builds. With whales re-accumulating and the chart running vertical, a move toward $0.00003 isn’t far-fetched. For a token named after failure, REKT is making early buyers anything but.\\n\\nBrett (BRETT): The Base-Powered Underdog With Giant Upside\\n\\nFresh off a crucial validation moment, a Binance US listing, BRETT has secured itself as one of the top meme drivers on Coinbase’s Base chain. While the price currently trades around $0.05, this meme coin boasts a past ATH of $0.23, giving room for a potential 4–5x rebound just to reclaim old highs.\\n\\nBRETT Price Chart | Source: CoinGecko\\n\\nWith a market cap under $600M and institutional coverage increasing, BRETT is on track to break into the Top-10 meme coin list. If liquidity injection from US traders grows post-Binance listing, analysts suggest a push toward $0.40-0.50 in the next altseason, representing a 7–10x return from here. Backed by strong moving-average support, BRETT is built for a comeback.\\n\\nSnek (SNEK): Cardano’s Bite-Back Meme Weapon\\n\\nSitting at $0.0036 with a $271M market cap, SNEK is already well-established — but far from finished. Having surged over 9,200% since launch, SNEK now benefits from renewed Cardano ecosystem support and recent partnerships with Input Output, which could make it the Shiba Inu of ADA’s chain.\\n\\nSNEK Price Chart | Source: CoinGecko\\n\\nWith meme season heating up again and Cardano gearing for a technical upgrade cycle, SNEK is tipped to claw back toward its $0.009 ATH, before pushing into $0.02–$0.025 territory. That’s a potential 6–7x upside, not bad for a “snake” that’s already bitten markets once before.\\n\\nThe Next 25x Winner Will Come From UNDER $1\\n\\nThe meme coin market is entering full-blown price discovery. With fresh liquidity pouring in and retail FOMO returning, sub-$1 tokens like Little Pepe, Rekt, Brett, and Snek offer the most explosive setups. Little Pepe remains unrivaled, combining viral marketing, deep infrastructure, audited credibility, and launchpad utility. If you’re hunting for a meme coin capable of 2,500% gains, this tiny frog is the one to watch. Join the Little Pepe presale now at Littlepepe.com.\\n\\nFor more information about Little Pepe (LILPEPE) visit the links below:\\n\\nWebsite: https://littlepepe.com\\n\\nWhitepaper: https://littlepepe.com/whitepaper.pdf\\n\\nTelegram: https://t.me/littlepepetoken\\n\\nTwitter/X: https://x.com/littlepepetoken\\n\\nThis is a Press Release provided by a third party who is responsible for the content. Please conduct your own research before taking any action based on the content.'},\n",
